主要工作】\n软件AI结合:帮助团队探索和整合最新的AI相关技术到软件端,包括但不限于基于LLM的代码辅助生成、多模\n态的软件交互模式探索等;\n2.技术探索验证:保持对AI相关技术发展趋势的关注,快速上手体验各务类AI类产品并尝试自己验证应用在CB上的\n产品demo,为团队提供探索方向的验证;\n3.产品需求跟进:负责部分软件产品模块的demo原型设计与可实现验证,并跟进到具体研发团队的实现;","evidence_sha256":"58c24cfecb888ed7eea18d1176f4de27bc38ad3b2ebd37c48779febda6a12050","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"正式"}],"job_id":"02add8c5-790d-5e41-9eab-0b7c6bf3d58a","location":"深圳","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:11:02.301855+00:00","public_job_key":"7670501318583159067","requirement":"1.全日制院校毕业生\n2.计算机科学与技术、电子信息工程、通信/自动化等相关专业2;\n3.对LLM时代的AI技术有强烈的热情和极高的敏感度;\n4.在校期间对各种AI类工具已有重度使用并产出过完整项目;\n【加分项】\n1.了解3D打印与创客群体,有自己动手做过硬件项目;\n2.熟悉C/C++,MicroPython,Java等至少一门语言;","source_kind":"job","source_url":"https://bambulab.jobs.feishu.cn/campus/position/7670501318583159067/detail","status":"unknown","title":"CyberBrick 产品运营- 软件AI方向"},{"channel":"社会招聘","content_note":"正文已从确定归档岗位记录恢复并保留段落；字段仅来自公开原始记录。 原始记录未提供可确认的开放状态，状态标为 unknown。","duty":"Role Summary:\nBambu Lab is seeking a skilled and detail-oriented Database Administrator (DBA / DBRE) to join our US branch. In this role, you will be responsible for the day-to-day operations, monitoring, and reliability of our cloud and local database environments. You will drive engineering solutions to ensure system stability, performance, and compliance with data privacy regulations.\nResponsibilities\n1. Cloud Operations: Own day-to-day operations, monitoring, and reliability of cloud databases (AWS RDS / Aurora, GCP Cloud SQL, etc.) and local databases (MySQL / PostgreSQL / Redis / SQL Server, etc.).\n2. Reliability Engineering (DBRE): Define and measure database SLOs, strengthen monitoring/alerting, and manage database resources using IaC (Terraform) with an emphasis on elasticity and stability.\n3. Backup & DR: Define and execute backup strategies and regular recovery drills to ensure data reliability and business continuity (RPO / RTO).\n4. Performance Optimization: Conduct SQL review, slow-query optimization, index planning, and parameter tuning.\n5. High Availability: Maintain highly available database architectures through replication, clustering, and failover management.\n6. Data Security & Compliance: Implement RBAC, auditing, encryption, and masking; ensure all data-layer security policies are strictly followed.\n7. Collaboration: Coordinate with local development, SRE, and security teams to drive database automation.","evidence_sha256":"07151ceaede08bef69947b7e76436c7fa8ba89ec67f7c36d561068921e50eefa","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"全职"}],"job_id":"123ae141-9636-50f3-bcc2-81b6a52c077e","location":"圣克拉拉","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:11:01.441493+00:00","public_job_key":"7669721163446487332","requirement":"1. Education & Experience: Bachelor's degree in Computer Science or a related field is preferred; however, equivalent professional work experience will be fully considered in lieu of a formal degree. 3+ years of DBA / DBRE experience is required.\n2. Technical Proficiency: Strong expertise in MySQL or PostgreSQL. Experience with Redis, SQL Server, or Oracle is a plus.\n3. Cloud Expertise: Proficient with AWS (RDS / Aurora) or GCP (Cloud SQL); experience with elastic scaling and HA configurations.\n4. Automation: Proficient in using IaC (Terraform) and scripting (Python / Shell) to automate database tasks.\n5. Observability: Hands-on experience with monitoring tools.\n6. Language & Soft Skills: Working proficiency in English for cross-team collaboration. Strong root-cause analysis and postmortem skills.\n7. Work Authorization: Must be legally authorized to work in the United States. We welcome all applicants legally authorized to work in the United States regardless of immigration status. The company is eligible and willing to sponsor H-1B work visas for qualified international candidates, including H-1B transfer applications.\n【Equal Employment Opportunity Statement】\nWe are an Equal Employment Opportunity Employer committed to compliance with all federal, state, and local anti-discrimination laws, including California’s Fair Employment and Housing Act (FEHA). All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religious creed, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, national origin, ancestry, age, physical or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, pregnancy, childbirth and related medical conditions, protected veteran status, or any other category protected under applicable federal, California state, and local laws.\n【Compensation & Immigration Information】\nPay Scale: $88,000 – $150,000 annual base salary\nWork Authorization: We welcome all applicants legally authorized to work in the United States. The company is eligible and willing to sponsor H-1B work visas for qualified international candidates; H-1B transfers from existing employers are also accepted.\n【Background Check】\nBackground verification will only be conducted after extending a conditional offer, and fully complies with applicable state and federal background check regulations.\nBy submitting an application for this role, you accept and agree to our global applicant privacy policy, which may be accessed here:https://bambulab.com/en/policies/page/candidate-privacy-notice\nIf you have any questions, please reach out to us at hr@bambulab.com.","source_kind":"job","source_url":"https://bambulab.jobs.feishu.cn/experienced/position/7669721163446487332/detail","status":"unknown","title":"Database Administrator (DBA / DBRE) - Cloud Database Operations & Reliability Engineering"},{"channel":"社会招聘","content_note":"正文已从确定归档岗位记录恢复并保留段落；字段仅来自公开原始记录。 原始记录未提供可确认的开放状态，状态标为 unknown。","duty":"1.参与建立或维护EHS管理体系，编制安全操作规程、应急预案等文件。\n2.组织环境因素、危险源辨识，排查隐患、制定整改措施。\n3.对接环保、安监等政府部门检查，处理合规文件。\n4.监督新/改/扩建项目的安全、环保、职业卫生设施与主体工工程同步设计施工。\n5.主导事故调查，分析原因并推动预防措施落地。","evidence_sha256":"07151ceaede08bef69947b7e76436c7fa8ba89ec67f7c36d561068921e50eefa","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"全职"}],"job_id":"c72528cd