esults.\n5. Team Leadership & Cross-Functional Collaboration: Responsible for team building, training, motivation, and performance management to enhance team expertise and collaboration efficiency. Maintain close communication and effective collaboration with other departments (such as product development, e-commerce, and marketing) to ensure social media operations align with overall business goals.\n6. Industry Research & Trend Leadership: Continuously research global social media trends and competitor dynamics. Introduce innovative operational concepts and practices, explore new business opportunities and market spaces, and maintain the company’s leading position in overseas social media.","evidence_sha256":"07151ceaede08bef69947b7e76436c7fa8ba89ec67f7c36d561068921e50eefa","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"全职"}],"job_id":"e82e4994-38b0-5626-8c29-c333f4616a36","location":"深圳","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:11:01.441493+00:00","public_job_key":"7546548745123399982","requirement":"1. Education: Bachelor’s degree or above in Marketing, Media, International Business, or related fields preferred.\n2. Experience: 5+ years of experience in overseas social media operations or digital marketing, with at least 3 years of team management experience. Proven track record of building successful overseas social media brands is a plus.\n3. Communication Skills: Excellent written and verbal communication skills in both Chinese and English. Capable of effective collaboration with international teams, external partners, and clients.\n4. Analytical & Problem-Solving Skills: Strong data analysis and logical thinking abilities, capable of extracting key insights from large datasets, identifying issues, and providing effective solutions. Skilled in data-driven decision-making and strategy optimization.\n5. Cross-Cultural Competence & Global Perspective: Outstanding cross-cultural communication skills with a broad global vision. Deep understanding of cultural differences, consumer behavio