ustry, leading the way with innovative products and services. Our Wiki and Academy are a fundamental part of our ecosystem, serving as valuable resources for our community. To take it to the next level by improving the information contained within, we are seeking a Technical Writer with a deep passion for 3D printing and exceptional technical writing skills.\nKey Responsibilities:\n- Create technical articles and documentation that provide clear and in-depth information on Bambu Lab 3D printers and services.\n- Translate complex technical information into user-friendly, accessible content.\n- Collaborate with subject matter experts and engineering teams to gather accurate, up-to-date information.\n- Ensure all content is well-organized, detailed, and maintains the highest quality standards.\n- Produce content in English with impeccable spelling, punctuation, and technical accuracy.\n- Contribute to the development and enhancement of our Wiki and Academy knowledge base.","evidence_sha256":"07151ceaede08bef69947b7e76436c7fa8ba89ec67f7c36d561068921e50eefa","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"全职"}],"job_id":"f448f372-3455-518e-b47c-67dbf365693a","location":"法兰克福、奥斯汀","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:11:01.441493+00:00","public_job_key":"7571666740229392646","requirement":"Qualifications:\n- Proven experience in 3D printing or other smart hardware product documentation.\n- A strong understanding of how 3D printing works and a deep passion for the technology.\n- Exceptional technical writing skills with the ability to make complex topics easy to understand.\n- Proven ability to create high-quality technical documentation which is easy to understand by everyone.\n- Keen attention to detail and commitment to accuracy in content creation.\n- Practical experience with 3D printer troubleshooting and repair is a plus.\n- Native-level proficiency in German and strong proficiency in English required., with an open-minded attitude and ability to communicate effectively across cultures.\nOthers:\nPlease submit your work sample or alternative proof along with your resume.\nA work sample showcasing your technical writing skills is mandatory during the application process. The work sample can be any previous technical writing project that demonstrates your capabilities.\nIf a work sample is not readily available, alternative proofs of your technical writing ability are also acceptable, such as:\n- A technical blog post or article authored by you.\n- An academic paper or report that you've written.\n- A detailed step-by-step guide on a technical topic.\n- Any other relevant document that highlights your technical writing expertise.","source_kind":"job","source_url":"https://bambulab.jobs.feishu.cn/experienced/position/7571666740229392646/detail","status":"unknown","title":"Technical Writer (German) – 3D Printing"},{"channel":"社会招聘","content_note":"正文已从确定归档岗位记录恢复并保留段落；字段仅来自公开原始记录。 原始记录未提供可确认的开放状态，状态标为 unknown。","duty":"1、负责架线、转线指导生产，测试环境维护，结构组装分析;\n2、负责解决产线异常确保生产正常运行，进行异常分析并提供详细数据及分析报告;\n3、改善现有工艺或引进新工艺，提升生产良率、效率和品质;\n4、负责ECN、PCN、DOE执行及结果输出流程闭环;\n5、协助工程师完成生产工艺制定、参数、辅料、BOM规范等工作。","evidence_sha256":"07151ceaede08bef69947b7e76436c7fa8ba89ec67f7c36d561068921e50eefa","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"全职"}],"job_id":"2d4cd4ee-7053-57ee-b7ea-7596e8f82b79","location":"深圳","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:11:01.441493+00:00","public_job_key":"7573971864353196315","requirement":"1、中专及以上学历;\n2、熟悉使用办公软件，掌握4M1E、5why等分析工具;\n3、有电脑、家电等消费级产品组装、整机测试经验优先;\n4、具备一定产品结构、机械测试工艺的分析能力;\n5、工作主动积极、具有高度的责任心，团队意识强，能承受较大的工作压力。","source_kind":"job","source_url":"https://bambulab.jobs.feishu.cn/experienced/position/7573971864353196315/detail","status":"unknown","title":"TPE技术员"},{"channel":"校园招聘","content_note":"正文已从确定归档岗位记录恢复并保留段落；字段仅来自公开原始记录。 原始记录未提供可确认的开放状态，状态标为 unknown。","duty":"1.负责架线、转线指导生产；测试环境维护，结构组装分析；\n2.负责解决产线异常确保生产正常运行；异常分析并提供详细数据及分析报告；\n3.改善现有工艺或引进新工艺，提升生产良率、效率和品质；\n4.负责ECN、PCN、DOE执行及结果输出流程闭环；\n5.协助工程师完成生产工艺制定、参数、辅料、BOM规范等工作。","evidence_sha256":"58c24cfecb888ed7eea18d1176f4d