vel on an as-needed basis.","source_kind":"job","source_url":"https://kwh0jtf778.jobs.feishu.cn/index/position/7031133107025987877/detail","status":"unknown","title":"Application Engineer"},{"channel":"社会招聘","content_note":"正文已从确定归档岗位记录恢复并保留段落；字段仅来自公开原始记录。 原始记录未提供可确认的开放状态，状态标为 unknown。","duty":"About the Role\nWe are looking for a client-facing AE to support our Global business.\nThis role partners closely with Sales and CPM to engage customers, drive technical discussions, and support new product adoption. You will act as the bridge between customers, product, and engineering, helping translate advanced lidar and perception technologies into real-world solutions.\nKey Responsibilities\nSupport customer meetings, technical discussions, and solution presentations\nLead product demos, evaluations, and on-site testing\nWork with customers across OEMs, Tier 1s, and autonomous driving / advanced technology companies\nSupport new product introduction (NPI) and customer integration (SDK, ROS, etc.)\nProvide hands-on technical support, including troubleshooting and root cause analysis\nCollaborate with R&D and global teams to drive technical alignment and feedback\nSupport RMA analysis and technical documentation as needed","evidence_sha256":"eb6fdf1d60e35a3d87394721a314a14c9b2ce6852b0355f02e3b26946cf1a365","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"全职"},{"label":"岗位类别","value":"智能制造 / 工业互联网 / 工业自动化"}],"job_id":"ea06c32b-e427-543a-a3c1-cb5be42f38fb","location":"上海","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:10:58.153665+00:00","public_job_key":"7645125807865923878","requirement":"Qualifications\nBachelor’s or Master’s degree in Engineering or related field\n3+ years in FAE, Solutions Engineering, or Technical Pre-Sales\nStrong client-facing experience and ability to lead technical conversations independently\nExperience with lidar, sensors, or perception systems preferred\nCamera / imaging experience is a strong plus\nStrong communication skills and ability to work cross-functionally\nWillingnes