assador management, brand campaign, and global event collaborations. This hands-on role requires a proactive, detail-oriented, and globally minded team player with strong English communication skills. The intern will contribute to high-impact projects aimed at elevating brand presence and delivering business results in a fast-paced environment.\nKey Responsibilities\n1.Assist in the coordination and rollout of branded campaigns, including ambassador activations and performance tracking.\n2.Support the organization and execution of brand partnership initiatives, helping to manage timelines, deliverables, and collaborative content.\n3.Coordinate logistics and support content delivery for global event collaborations (physical and virtual), working with internal teams and external partners.\n4.Contribute to the preparation of pitch decks, reports, and marketing collateral to support campaign launches and partnership proposals.\n5.Help ensure consistency and quality in all deliverables, aligning with brand guidelines across platforms and regions.\n6.Collaborate across functions (creative, PR, regional marketing, digital marketing, events) to support campaign execution and co-branded content creation.\n7.Participate in team meetings and provide timely updates on project progress and challenges.","evidence_sha256":"1ccb8e65eab52039c74614a5222027c456787363e182f5e2dbd36fbb5da19928","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"实习"}],"job_id":"98de66c5-76b8-5a36-86f9-0d33d278b6de","location":"深圳","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:11:22.493776+00:00","public_job_key":"7655535714846755108","requirement":"Qualifications\n1.Currently pursuing a Bachelor’s or Master’s in Marketing, Communications, Business Administration, or a related field.\n2.Excellent command of written and spoken English; effective communicator in a multicultural environment.\n3.Demonstrated interest in brand marketing, ambassador programs, events, and brand partnerships.\n4.Prior internship or project experience in marketing, communications, or event management (preferred).\n5.Strong attention to detail, organizational skills, and ability to work quickly under pressure.\n6.Proactive, accountable, and adaptive team player, eager to contribute and learn in a fast-moving setting.\n7.Required to work onsite in Shenzhen a minimum of 4 days per week.\nKey Attributes\n1.Global outlook with high cross-cultural sensitivity.\n2.Action-oriented, solutions-driven, and able to deliver work at speed.\n3.Positive, collaborative approach with readiness to take initiative and responsibility.\n4.This refined scope ensures the intern’s focus is on brand campaign execution, ambassador and partnership programs, and support for global event collaborations—directly contributing to brand impact without a research emphasis.","source_kind":"job","source_url":"https://arashivision.jobs.feishu.cn/campus/position/7655535714846755108/detail","status":"unknown","title":"Brand Marketing Intern"},{"channel":"社会招聘","content_note":"正文已从确定归档岗位记录恢复并保留段落；字段仅来自公开原始记录。 原始记录未提供可确认的开放状态，状态标为 unknown。","duty":"1. Find New Partnerships: Identify and pursue new brand partnerships that align with Antigravity's global strategy.\n2. Create Partnership Plans: Develop and implement strategies that increase brand visibility, engagement, and sales in key markets.\n3. Negotiate & Execute Agreements: Handle contract negotiations, ensuring clear terms and goals for both Antigravity and partners.\n4. Maximize ROI: Ensure partnerships are profitable and strengthen long-term relationships while maintaining brand integrity.\n5. Team Collaboration: Work with internal teams (marketing, sales, product) to ensure partnership efforts support Insta360’s business and marketing goals.\n6. Build Strong Relationships: Foster ongoing relationships with brand partners to ensure successful, long-lasting partnerships.\n7. Serve as the main point of contact for partners, addressing any issues or opportunities that arise.\n8. Manage Expectations and communicate regularly with partners to ensure smooth execution of partnership programs.\n9. Leverage partnerships to support key product launches and sales campaigns.\n10. Monitor and report on partnership performance using metrics like engagement, reach, and sales to ensure goals are met.\n11. Provide regular updates on partnership success and share recommendations for improvements.\n12. Stay up-to-date on industry trends and competitors, using insights to identify potential new partners.\n13.Secure events opportunities and work with our Events team to implement.\n14.Support Enterprise Partnerships: Help develop strategies for emerging markets and support high-level partnerships with case studies.","evidence_sha256":"d02a19565ac42022e0ce3c451db082eb5b3ade07c5a0b4fd1027cba1e44985c4","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"全职"}],"job_id":"e2781149-ae9b-5339-9a73-3a3624220cdc","location":"慕尼黑","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:11:21.485949+00:00","public_job_key":"7595921041365944614","requirement":"1. BS/MS in Marketing or applicable areas of study\n2. 3+ years of experience in Brand Partnerships/Marketing/Advertising\n3. Excellent project management, communication and interpersonal skills\n4. Collaborative, motivated and excels in team-oriented work style","source_kind":"job","source_url":"https://arashivision.jobs.feishu.cn/socialENG/position/7595921041365944614/detail","status":"unknown","title":"Business Development Manager（欧洲市场）"},{"channel":"校园招聘","content_note":"正文已从确定归档岗位记录恢复并保留段落；字段仅来自公开原始记录。 原始记录未提供可确认的开放状态，状态标为 unknown。","duty":"1、参与智能影像硬件的系统软件开发，覆盖从设备启动到影像采集的整条链路。\n2、参与 Android 系统层开发，涉及系统服务、跨进程通信、硬件抽象层、系统应用等方向。\n3、持续优化系统的启动速度、运行稳定性、性能与功耗表现。\n4、与驱动、算法团队协作，把算法能力接入系统，调到量产可用的质量。\n5、用系统级追踪工具在真机上定位性能与稳定性问题，提出方案并落地验证。\n6、深度参与产品从原型验证到量产交付的完整研发周期。","evidence_sha256":"1ccb8e65eab52039c74614a5222027c456787363e182f5e2dbd36fbb5da19928","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"正式"}],"job_id":"ae378599-54e0-5381-b3c7-289b1e50c517","location":"深圳","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:11:22.493776+00:00"