\n- Prepare and manage event kits, demo units, and marketing assets\n- Provide on-site support at events (when feasible)\n- Manage and organize the event warehouse in our Unterschleißheim office\n- Track inventory and ensure smooth product and material availability for events\n- Collaborate closely with internal teams and external partners across multiple markets\n---\nYour Profile\n- Currently enrolled in a university in Munich or nearby (mandatory for working student status)\n- Available to work 2–3 days per week\n- Strong organizational skills and attention to detail\n- Hands-on, proactive mindset with a willingness to learn\n- Comfortable working in a dynamic, international environment\n- Fluent in English (Chinese, German or French is a plus)\n- Interest in events, marketing, or logistics\n---\nWhat We Offer\n- A hands-on role with real ownership and impact from day one\n- The chance to work on major European events and activations\n- Direct mentorship from experienced Event Managers\n- Exposure to the tech and content creation industry\n- A dynamic, international team environment in Munich\n- Opportunity to grow your career and build strong industry experience\n---\nWhy Join Us?\nAt Insta360, we are redefining the way people capture and share the world. As part of our European team, you will play a key role in bringing our brand to life through events and experiences.","evidence_sha256":"d02a19565ac42022e0ce3c451db082eb5b3ade07c5a0b4fd1027cba1e44985c4","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"实习"}],"job_id":"ae39c901-037d-542f-ade6-a5fa93a41043","location":"慕尼黑","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:11:21.485949+00:00","public_job_key":"7649274399707760915","requirement":"/","source_kind":"job","source_url":"https://arashivision.jobs.feishu.cn/socialENG/position/7649274399707760915/detail","status":"unknown","title":"Working Student - Event & Logistics"},{"channel":"社会招聘","content_note":"正文已从确定归档岗位记录恢复并保留段落；字段仅来自公开原始记录。 原始记录未提供可确认的开放状态，状态标为 unknown。","duty":"Are you obsessed with content, cameras, and creating things people actually want to watch? Do you want to build something from scratch, your own stage, your own voice, backed by a global action camera brand? Then keep reading.\nWe're Insta360, a global leader in 360° and action cameras. Our Unterschleißheim office is looking for a creative powerhouse to help us build and own our German-language social media presence — from concept to camera to publish.\nWHAT YOU'LL DO\nOwn and grow our German-language TikTok, YouTube and Instagram channels: you'll be the face, the voice, and the creative force behind them\nCreate compelling short-form video content using Insta360 cameras and professional gear, from concept and shooting to editing and publishing\nHost live streams on TikTok: engaging with our community in real time and building a loyal following\nExecute our social media strategy in close alignment with our global HQ team, bringing the international vision to life for the DACH market\nAttend events across Germany and Austria (trade shows, sports events, activations) and capture content on the ground\nSupport with graphic design work for social media assets, stories, thumbnails, and campaign visuals\nMonitor trends, analyze performance metrics, and iterate quickly on what resonates with our audience\nCollaborate with our marketing team locally and contribute ideas to content planning sessions\nWHAT WE'RE LOOKING FOR\nMust-haves\nNative German speaker: you'll be the authentic German voice of our brand\nCurrently enrolled in a Bachelor's or Master's program (any field welcome: marketing, communication, film, design, sports, etc.)\nGenuine passion for social media, content creation, and being in front of (or behind) the camera\nHands-on experience creating and editing short-form video content (TikTok, Reels, YouTube Shorts)\nSelf-starter mentality: you take initiative, run with ideas, and don't wait to be told what to do\nComfortable being on camera and hosting live content\nFluent in English for HQ alignment and international team communication\nNice-to-haves\nExperience with graphic design tools (Adobe Creative Suite, Figma, Canva)\nFamiliarity with action sports, outdoor, travel, or tech culture\nExperience growing social channels from scratch or managing a personal brand/channel\nBasic photography or videography skills beyond smartphone content\nWillingness to travel frequently within Germany and Austria for events\nWHAT WE OFFER\nThe chance to build something real: you'll have ownership over our German social channels from day one\nAccess to the full Insta360 product lineup to create content with: yes, you'll actually use the cameras\nA front-row seat at events all over Germany and Austria: sports, tech, lifestyle, and more\nClose collaboration with our international HQ team, real exposure to global brand building\nA fun, international team in a modern office in Unterschleißheim with easy access from Munich\nFlexible working hours that fit around your studies\nReal perspective for a full-time position after graduation, we hire from within\nHOW TO APPLY\nSend us your CV and more importantly, a short intro video (max. 60 seconds) about introducing yourself. Plus Point: Links to content you've created (social profiles, videos, anything that shows us how you think and create). We don't need a formal cover letter; just show us who you are.","evidence_sha256":"d02a19565ac42022e0ce3c451db082eb5b3ade07c5a0b4fd1027cba1e44985c4","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"实习"}],"job_id":"b9823262-e45a-5162-ac22-52b79a9fba7d","location":"慕尼黑","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:11:21.485949+00:00","public_job_key":"7649272890021923078","requirement":"/","source_kind":"job","source_url":"https://arashivision.jobs.feishu.cn/socialENG/position/7649272890021923078/detail","status":"unknown","title":"Working Student-Social Media"},{"channel":"校园招聘","content_note":"正文已从确定归档岗位记录恢复并保留段落；字段仅来自公开原始记录。 原始记录未提供可确认的开放状态，状态标为 unknown。","duty":"1. 大规模场景几何重建：研发基于多视图几何（MVS）与深度估计的重建算法，解决大规模户外场景下的尺度漂移、遮挡恢复及几何拓扑提取难题，实现从非结构化影像到高精度几何实体的转化。\n2. 神经表征与渲染算法优化：深入研究并改进 3D/2D Gaussian Splatting (GS) 或 其他生成式算法，针对具身智能仿真需求，优化大规模场景的显存管理、分块策略及长序列渲染的几何一致性。\n3. 算法管线工程化：设计并实现高性能、可扩展的三维重建算法流水线；负责重建系统中的核心算子优化（如 CUDA 核函数开发），提升大规模数据的吞吐量与处理效率。\n4. 技术指标与评估体系：建立针对大规模重建的端到端评测方案，包括几何精度、法线质量及光影准确性，通过数据驱动的方式持续迭代算法性能，支撑闭环仿真训练。","evidence_sha256":"1ccb8e65eab52039c74614a5222027c456787363e182f5e2dbd36fbb5da19928","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"实习"}],"job_id":"882731c8-4550-5e02-97af-f601fae62468","location":"深圳","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:11:22.493776+00:00","public_job_key":"7658194072569923846","requirement":"1. 扎实的算法基础：计算机视觉、机器人或数学相关专业；精通多视图几何（MVS）、SfM、SLAM、点云处理及非线性优化。\n2. 核心技术积累：在 3DGS、神经渲染或大规模三维重建领域有深入研究，具备处理大规模、弱纹理或复杂光照场景的实战经验。\n3. 卓越的工程实现能力：\n• 精通 C++ 与 Python，具备严谨的编程习惯与系统架构设计能力；\n• 熟悉 PyTorch/LibTorch 框架，能够独立复现前沿论文并进行工程化改进；\n• 硬核加分：具备 CUDA 或 TensorRT 开发经验，能够编写高效的并行计算算子以解决渲染或计算瓶颈。\n4. 具身背景优先：具有具身智能或自动驾驶企业/实验室实习经验，熟悉重建算法如何服务于感知算法训练或闭环仿真系统。\n加分项：\n1. 在 CVPR、ICCV、ECCV、NeurIPS、SIGGRAPH 等顶级学术会议发表过高水平论文。\n2. 在 GitHub 上拥有高质量开源项目，或在三维重建、SLAM 相关国际竞赛中取得优异成绩。","source_kind":"job","source_url":"https://arashivision.jobs.feishu.cn/campus/position/7658194072569923846/detail","status":"unknown","title":"三维重建算法实习生"},{"channel":"校园招聘","content_note":"正文已从确定归档岗位记录恢复并保留段落；字段仅来自公开原始记录。 原始记录未提供可确认的开放状态，状态标为 unknown。","duty":"1、项目的风险专利排除，无效检索；\n2、项目技术点挖掘，专利申请核稿；\n3、其他辅助事项。","evidence_sha256":"1ccb8e65eab52039c74614a5222027c456787363e182f5e2dbd36fbb5da19928","fields":[{"label":"招聘类型","value":"正式"}],"job_id":"89b54888-f9df-5115-b8df-ba49bbc7080f","location":"深圳","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:11:22.493776+00:00","public_job_key":"7663421753267423507","requirement":"1、理工科+法律双背景优先；\n2、有专利实习经验优先；\n3、有代理师证书更优。","source_kind":"job","source_url":"https://arashivision.jobs.feishu.cn/campus/position/7663421753267423507/detail","status":"unknown","title":"专利工程师-2027校招"},{"channel":"校园招聘","content_note":"正文已从确定归档岗位记录恢复并保留段落；字段仅来自公开原始记录。 原始记录未提供可确认的开放状态，状态标为 unknown。","duty":"1、项目全周期管理：主导影石品牌专卖店从设计到施工验收