 engineering. From small precision components to large industrial assemblies, SHINING 3D metrology solutions deliver the accuracy, repeatability, and efficiency demanded by modern manufacturing.\nNEW\nOptimScan Q12/Q9 HD\nHigh-precision 3D inspection system\nHOT\nFreeScan Omni Series 🛜\nStandalone inspection-ready metrology 3D scanner\nHOT\nFreeScan Trak Nova 🛜\nDynamic 3D scanning and tracking system\nHOT\nFreeScan Combo Series\nLaser handheld 3D scanner\nHOT\nFreeScan UE Pro2 🛜\nLaser handheld 3D scanner\nFreeScan Trak ProW 🛜\nDynamic 3D scanning and tracking system\nAutoScan Inspec2\nAutomatic desktop 3D scanner\nDiscover our metrology 3D solutions\nProfessional 3D Scanners · EinScan\nCombining ease of use with professional-grade performance, EinScan scanners enable fast and reliable 3D data capture across engineering, design, education, healthcare, and creative applications. Trusted by professionals worldwide, EinScan empowers professionals and creators to digitize the physical world with confidence.\nNEW\nEinScan Trak 🛜\nWireless Marker-Free Tracking System\nEinScan Libre 🛜\nAll-in-one laser 3D scanner: wireless, markerless, and full-color\nHOT\nEinScan Rigil Series 🛜\nThe tri-mode laser handheld 3D scanner\nEinScan Medixa 🛜\nAll-in-one 3D scanner created for O&P care\nEinScan SP/SE V2\nDesktop 3D scanner\nDiscover our professional 3D solutions\nGot Questions While Choosing A 3D Scanner?\nGet in touch with our experts for:\nFree consultation and application assessment\nPersonalized product recommendations\nCustom quotations tailored to your requirements\nLive demonstrations and on-site evaluation support\nTalk to our experts\nCompatible Software Package\nSHINING3D Inspect\nfor 3D inspection\nEXModel Pro\nfor reverse engineering\nBlueStar Mapping\nfor texture mapping\nPolyworks\nGeomagic Control X\nGeomagic Design X\nA Reliable Manufacturer of 3D Scanners\nBook a Demo →\nValidate the 3D scanning performace onsite or online. Book a demo of your parts with our expert enginneers!\nBecome a Reseller →\nPartner with us to bring high-accuracy 3D vision solutions to the world! Together, let’s make advanced 3D scanning technology accessible to industries everywhere.\nLoyal Client Trade-In →\nTrade in your existing 3D scanner and move up to the latest SHINING 3D technology with exclusive upgrade benefits for loyal users.\nWhat You Can Achieve with Our Scanners\nDiscover the ways in which integrating our scanners into your workflow can enhance efficiency and help you achieve remarkable results.\nTalk to our experts\nQuality Inspection\n3D scanners for quality inspection have revolutionized quality control by replacing slow, manual gauging with rapid, high-precision automated inspection. This non-destructive testing method drastically accelerates inspection cycles, reduces waste, and ensures absolute compliance with strict tolerances.\nReverse Engineering\n3D scanners make reverse engineering faster and more accurate by converting existing parts and prototypes into editable CAD models. This digital workflow preserves precise geometry, simplifies redesigns, and helps teams modernize legacy components efficiently.\nDigital Archiving & Documentation\n3D scanners for digital archiving and documentation are vital for creating flawless, permanent digital records of historical artifacts, museum collections, architectural sites and others. High-resolution 3D models ensures that history is accurately preserved and globally accessible for generations to come.\nProduct Development & Design\n3D scanners for product development and design accelerate the innovation cycle by seamlessly transitioning physical concepts into digital workflows. This allows for rapid iteration, complex surface modeling, and seamless integration into computer-aided styling (CAS) workflows. By capturing real-world geometry instantly, design teams can skip tedious manual measurements, reduce time-to-market, and optimize products for both form and function.\nHuman Body Scanning & Medical Digitization\n3D scanners for human body scanning and medical digitization have transformed healthcare by creating highly accurate, contact-free 3D models of the human anatomy. 3D scanning technology enhances patient comfort, streamlines manufacturing workflows, and elevates personalization in patient care.\nResearch & Education\n3D scanners for research and education serve as powerful tools for experiential learning and advanced data analysis. In the classroom, they bring abstract concepts to life, allowing students in engineering, manufacturing, and archaeology to interact with precise digital replicas of complex objects. For researchers, they provide accurate, quantifiable data for geometric analysis, product evaluation, and computer simulations.\nAnd More to Discover!\nCore component design technology for cameras, projectors, and wireless computing modules\nIntegrated opto-mechatronics and computing control system\nReal-time stereo reconstruction algorithm for 3D vision\n3D geometric modeling, data processing software and certified, customized inspection module\nHigh-accuracy calibration technology for 3D optical measurement\nOur Core Technology\nWe’ve been dedicated to optical 3D measurement, focusing on accuracy and innovation since 2004. Our products are known for their high accuracy, high precision, excellent texture quality, and fine geometric details.\nVerified Precision:\nInside Our 1100㎡ CNAS-Accredited Accuracy Lab\nThis expansive, CNAS-accredited facility is staffed by expert metrologists and certified to perform a comprehensive range of advanced calibration and testing projects. By rigorously adhering to the strictest international standards (like VDI/VDE and ISO), we ensure every 3D scanner, from R&D to production, is verified for world-class, metrology-grade accuracy.\nLearn more\nAward-Winning Products\nRed Dot Winner 2024 & 2026\niF Design Award 2022 & 2026\nRecognized \"Emerging Leader\" in Metrology\n2024 3D Scanning & Metrology Company\nLatest Updates from SHINING 3D\nPR/News\nSHINING 3D Metrology Introduces New Product Members Through Four Manufacturing Scenarios\nLearn More\nPR/News\nSHINING 3D Launches EinScan Trak: the World’s First Wireless, Dual-Form, Marker-Free Tracking System\nPR/News\nSHINING 3D Partnered with RMIT University to Support Additive Manufacturing at WorldSkills Australia’s 2026 Global Skills Challenge\nPR/News\nSHINING 3D Achieves Level 4 in ISO 56005 Innovation & Intellectual Property Management Capability Evaluation\nTrusted Worldwide\nLet's explore why SHINING 3D is the go-to choice for experts across various industries.\nExplore all case studies\nAutomotive\nHow 3D Scanning Transforms Custom Land...\nLearn More\nEngineering Machinery & Other Transportation\n3D Scanning Improves Mold Inspection...\nLearn More\nOrthotics & Prosthetics\nData-Driven O&P Care Starts with...\nLearn More\nAutomotive\nBlack Falcon Integrates 3D Scanning...\nLearn More\nAutomotive\nAccelerating Automotive Paint...\nLearn More\n\"I definitely see 3D scanning as an integral part of motorsports in the future. Because in motorsports, it's often custom solutions. And to solve it, 3D scanning can always help. I think 3D scanning will become a standard in motorsports\".\nElias Hountondji,\nPilot & Engineer @RedBull DriftBrothers\nWatch on YouTube\n\"I‘d really like to thank SHINING 3D for really pushing the limits of technology and giving their customers something that they can use in a practical basis, everyday basis to help my business grow as well\".\nSaad Kanno,\nBabylon Engineering\nWatch on YouTube\n\"There are a lot of people with amputations in Africa, and most of them have never been to school or only have some basic knowledge. the EinScan H2 has made it possible for those without too much knowledge to learn and use it well. It is worth mentioning its accuracy, which helped us a lot\".\nMerel van der Stelt,\nPhD, 3D Lab Radboudumc\nWatch on YouTube\n\"SHINING 3D is a good partner. They are always open to face challenges and keeps learning. When we provide the needs, they always understands our needs and then creates the products we want \".\nMichel Babin,\nCEO, TechMed\nWatch on YouTube\n\"I work with a lot of companies, but I have to say that SHINING3D has the best customer service. They are committed to promoting the user experience, and when I have a problem, it is always resolved with incredible speed\".\nTerence Whitty,\nOwner, Fabdent\nWatch on YouTube\n\"SHINING 3D has many awesome products, such as Aoralscan 3. It's a great product, compared to others, it's lighter, scans faster, more accurate, and very easy to operate. It has helped make the experience more efficient and comfortable for my clinic and my patients\".\nDr. Mark A. Kleive,\nOwner, Mark Kleive DDS PA\nWatch on YouTube\n\"SHINING 3D has a complete line of dental products which are used in my entire workflow. It has dramatically reduced my chair time with patients and increased my work efficiency \".\nDr. Isaac Tawil,\nCo Director, Advanced Implant Education\nWatch on YouTube","title":"High Accuracy 3D Scanning Solution for Your Industry | SHINING 3D"}],"jobs":[{"channel":"校园招聘","content_note":"正文已从确定归档岗位记录恢复并保留段落；字段仅来自公开原始记录。 原始记录未提供可确认的开放状态，状态标为 unknown。","duty":"1.负责光固化3D打印齿科专用光敏树脂的配方开发与迭代工作；\n2.参与齿科临床产品需求分析，开展针对性配方设计、样品制备、性能表征测试与改性优化工作；\n3.主导齿科光敏树脂小试、中试验证环节，对量产产线开展工艺落地指导与参数固化；\n4.跟进树脂打印适配性、生物相容性、精度稳定性等专项测试，解决配方与设备匹配问题；\n5.规范整理配方台账、工艺文件、检测报告及专利申报等相关技术文档。","evidence_sha256":"85979bfa55bb6c873e7ea72c2f93ecec9f788b47bafbadd18bb26ae81bb7c310","fields":[{"label":"薪资","value":"面议"},{"label":"招聘类型","value":"全职"},{"label":"岗位类别","value":"校园招聘"}],"job_id":"3733cf75-c87e-57fb-884f-f203c66132ea","location":"杭州","observed_at":"2026-09-06T14:11:14.107547+00:00","public_job_key":"390851179","requirement":"1.2027届应届毕业生，硕士及以上学历，博士优先，高分子材料、应用化学、材料化学等相关专业；\n2.熟悉光固化光敏树脂完整研发流程，有齿科材料、医用高分子相关课题经验者优先；\n3.具备严谨的实验设计、数据整理与问题分析能力，能针对性优化树脂力学、固化精度、生物安全等关键指标；\n4.了解齿科医用材料基础规范与检测标准，有相关表征测试实操经验优先；\n5.具备良好团队协作